---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="How Jamie Maguire Garden Design handles the details you send through this website.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
      <p class="lead">Short version: I only use your details to reply to you.</p>

      <h2>What I collect</h2>
      <p>
        If you use the contact form, I receive the name, email address and message you type. This website sets no
        cookies and does not track visitors.
      </p>

      <h2>How it is used</h2>
      <p>
        Your message is emailed to me (via the email service Resend, which delivers it to my inbox) so that I can
        reply. It is not stored on this website, not shared for marketing and not sold.
      </p>

      <h2>How long I keep it</h2>
      <p>I keep enquiry emails for as long as needed to deal with your enquiry and any work that follows.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under UK data protection law you can ask to see, correct or delete the personal information I hold about you.
        Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and I will help.
      </p>
      <p>You can also complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at ico.org.uk.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
